 {
  "text": "Good morning, everyone, and welcome to our city tour of Brasilia. My name is Rodrigo, and I am your guide today. First, we will visit the Cathedral. It has a beautiful glass roof. Then we will see the Three Powers Square and the National Congress. At twelve, we will have lunch near the TV Tower. On weekends, there is a big market there, so you can buy a souvenir. Please stay with the group, and take many photos. Let's go!",
  "voice": "arthur",
  "file": "a24_listening_tour_guide.mp3"
 },
 {
  "text": "Hi, Dienane, it is Carla! I saw your photos from Brasilia. They are beautiful! So, tell me everything. Did you like the city? Did you visit the Cathedral? Where did you stay? And did you buy a souvenir for me? I am only joking! Call me tonight, and tell me about the trip. Bye!",
  "voice": "ellen",
  "file": "a24_listening_carla_questions.mp3"
 },
 {
  "text": "Marcos asks, where did you go last month? Dienane answers, I went to Brasilia. Marcos asks, did you take a city tour? Dienane answers, yes, I did, with a great guide. Then Marcos asks, did you buy a souvenir? Dienane answers, no, I didn't, but I took many photos.",
  "voice": "arthur",
  "file": "pc24_order_brasilia.mp3"
 },
